B.Yf=new A.jY("wand","WAND","w",2,18,32,!0,3,"DEGAUSSING WAND \u2014 a hard magnetic wipe across the desk. Strips a mask, puts the transmitters back on air, makes her hand the pile back, and stops the lines ringing. It does not banish anything.")
